<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stocks down 1.06 pct on rupiah, H1 results.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stocks down 1.06 pct on rupiah, H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jakarta stocks was down 1.06 percent at midday on Wednesday on worries over the central bank's tight rupiah policy and poor first-half results of some big-capitalised companies, brokers said.</p>
